 reference states seven crew members, not six astronauts.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-015\",\n      \"verdict\": \"CONTRADICTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"during their space shuttle launch on January 28, 1986\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference states January 28, 1986, not Feb. 28, 1986.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-016\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The spectacular news of the Uranus encounter was interrupted the same day by the tragic Challenger accident\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference directly states this claim.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":57432,"type":"result","duration_ms":72355,"uuid":"c807e6df-58db-480a-bfd5-2430fd7848cd","ttft_stream_ms":872,"time_to_request_ms":112,"first_content_frame_ms":873,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
